-- MT2009_PLUS_BELTS_V1 - the belt system (Pasy). Autor: Digi Rasta (nowy-system v0.27.0,
-- SYSTEMY/pasy.md), ported into MT2009 PLUS. Mistrz (20082), beside the Blacksmith in M1
-- and M3 of every kingdom (spawned by the Dockerfile), opens the cube window with the nine
-- belt recipes of cube.pasy.txt. Odlamki Energii: quest energia_alchemik; Kamienie
-- Plomienia: the Razador and Nemere chests (special_item_group.dungeons.txt). The belts are
-- refined at the Blacksmith (refine_proto as it is); a belt's grade (value0) opens the
-- slots of the 4x4 belt inventory for potions (the client's belt window).
-- Dodano wytwarzanie Cor Draconis (3:1) - Opcja dialogowa u Mistrza.
-- cp1250; no literal ends with a Polish letter (qc).
quest pasy begin
	state start begin
		when 20082.chat."Wytwarzanie pasow" begin
			setskin(NOWINDOW)
			cmdchat("CubeCategory belts")
			command("cube open")
		end

		when 20082.chat."Wytwarzanie Cor Draconis" begin
			setskin(NOWINDOW)
			cmdchat("CubeCategory cors")
			command("cube open")
		end
	end
end
